The STK500/1 board supports a set of devices which are directly available and mounted on it. These devices can be configured by adding attributes inside the BOARD_DATA section.

The supported devices and the API functions needed to use them are described in the following sections. Please note that the current version of the board support only supports the AVR model ATMEGA128. Please remember that you have to connect ISP6PIN plug of the STK500 with the SPROG plug of the STK501 through 6-wires cable.

